msgstr "Wechselt das aktuelle Arbeitsverzeichnis zu *path*."

#: ../../library/os.rst:2175
msgid ""
"This function can support :ref:`specifying a file descriptor <path_fd>`.  "
"The descriptor must refer to an opened directory, not an open file."
msgstr ""
"Diese Funktion kann die :ref:`Angabe eines Dateideskriptors <path_fd>` "
