"This function can raise :exc:`OSError` and subclasses such "
"as :exc:`FileNotFoundError`, :exc:`PermissionError`, "
"and :exc:`NotADirectoryError`."
msgstr ""
"Diese Funktion kann :exc:`OSError` und Unterklassen "
"wie :exc:`FileNotFoundError`, :exc:`PermissionError` "
